title: 'googlePublicData: Working with Google''s ''Public Data Explorer'' DSPL Metadata
  Files'
version: 0.16.1
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.googlePublicData
abstract: Provides a collection of functions to set up 'Google Public Data Explorer'
  <https://www.google.com/publicdata/> data visualization tool with your own data,
  building automatically the corresponding DataSet Publishing Language file, or DSPL
  (XML), metadata file jointly with the CSV files. All zip-up and ready to be published
  in 'Public Data Explorer'.
